    "moreThanCurrentBestView": "The normative render pipeline exposes only point, line and triangle primitive topologies, while the official CTS separately demonstrates a compute pipeline writing a storage texture directly to GPUCanvasContext.getCurrentTexture(). This turns N220's synthetic direct-evaluation route into a concrete standards-level backend candidate without claiming that KAOPU's surface solver is already implemented.",
    "runnableEvidence": [
      "Normative WebGPU specification",
