    "A full operation pass remains candidate-eligible only; it is not reference acceptance, engineering truth or user acceptance.",
    "If a triangle-free runtime/display claim is made, bind the runtime subject and evaluation trace separately from the authoring BRep.",
    "Require coverage of every production render pass and record whether tessellation or triangle primitives/buffers were invoked or observed.",
    "Reject any route that infers triangle-free runtime from exact authoring geometry while the display route emits PolyBrep, UsdGeomMesh, Hydra mesh, or triangles.",
