    "Reject any GPURenderPipeline draw/drawIndexed route using triangle-list or triangle-strip, including a hidden fullscreen composite triangle.",
    "A compute-storage-canvas route is candidate-eligible only when all command encoders are observed, renderDrawCallCount is zero, at least one compute dispatch and storage texture write are observed, and the canvas format supports STORAGE_BINDING on the exact device."
